  "result": "Workspaces now carry a time zone, and every day boundary Taskflow computes is taken on that clock. The full suite passes (624 tests), `tsc --noEmit` is clean, and eslint is clean on the touched files.\n\nTwo things are not covered by this change:\n- The UI overdue badges (`kanban-card`, `issue-row`, `issue-card`, `issue-detail`, `issue-due-date-field`) still call `isOverdue(dueAt)` with the UTC default, so they can disagree with the server for non-UTC workspaces. Threading the zone into those components is a separate change.\n- `scripts/manifest-parts` still shows the old signatures for `isOverdue`, `digestWindow`, `groupByDay` and `shouldRunForOrg`. I left `corpus-manifest.json` alone.",
